# Skin & Care brand assets

Read **docs/Brand/SKIN_AND_CARE_GUIDELINES.md** before changing logos, favicons, or consumer colors.

## Rules

1. **Logo SSOT:** `unified-dashboard/assets/images/logo-panda.svg` (also copied to `assets/brand/logo-panda.svg` for sync).
2. **Consumer tokens:** `unified-dashboard/assets/css/skin-care-tokens.css` — do not reintroduce `somo-tokens.css`.
3. **Sync:** After changing brand files, run `npm run brand:favicons` then `npm run brand:sync`.
4. **Do not** add Somo gecko PNGs, `somo-logo.png`, or deprecated wordmark SVGs to UI.
5. **Provider sidebar:** panda SVG + "Skin & Care" wordmark via `provider-shell-chrome.js`.
6. **Email:** use `middleware-platform/lib/skin-care-email-layout.js` and journal blue palette (`#314db6`).

## Quick reference

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Nav / auth logo | `/assets/images/logo-panda.svg` |
| Primary blue | `#314db6` (`--sc-brand-blue`) |
| Cream background | `#f8f3ea` (`--sc-cream`) |
| Display font | Gloock |
| UI font | DM Sans |
